  "result": "Perfect! All 46 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**Functions to src/invoices.js:**\n\n1. **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds or updates a line:\n   - Adds a new line at the end if the SKU doesn't exist\n   - Increases qty if the SKU already exists\n   - Validates qty (QTY_INVALID) and SKU (UNKNOWN_SKU) like createInvoice\n   - Refuses to edit non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n\n2. **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line:\n   - Removes the line with the given SKU\n   - Returns LINE_NOT_FOUND if SKU isn't on the invoice\n   - Returns NO_LINES if it would remove the only line\n   - Refuses to edit non-draft invoices (NOT_DRAFT)\n\n**Error codes added to src/errors.js:**\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 Can only edit draft invoices\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 No line with that SKU on the invoice\n\n**Tests cover:**\n- Adding new lines and updating existing lines\n- Validation of quantity and SKU\n- Draft-only enforcement\n- Edge cases (last line removal, unknown SKU)\n- Input immutability for both functions",
